@startuml
title riskdep - from a block to an alert
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FDEEEE
  BorderColor #B54A4A
}
start
:Poll the head every 12 s;
if (a block has 2 confirmations?) then (no)
  :Wait for the next poll;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Fetch the logs of the watched contracts;
if (any event, gap or refresh due?) then (yes)
  :Full state read at one block;
else (no)
  :Light read: oracle prices,
total assets, idle, gates;
endif
:Event rules on the decoded logs;
:State rules: compare with the previous read;
if (a vault oracle fell >= 2 %?) then (yes)
  :OracleImpact: the loss now,
what is liquidatable, the verdict;
else (no)
endif
:Write the alerts (terminal, JSON);
:Save the cursor last;
stop
@enduml
